{"step_index":630,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-15T04:09:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-15T13:09:26+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-15T13:09:29+09:00\nThe search for \"\"816-87-02025\" \"페타브루\"\" returned the following summary:\n제시해주신 **‘816-87-02025’**는 고주파 레이더 및 지능형 센서 신호처리 기술 전문 기업인 **‘주식회사 페타브루(PETABREW)’**의 **사업자등록번호**입니다[1]. \n\n* **기업명:** 주식회사 페타브루 (PETABREW)[1]\n* **사업자등록번호:** 816-87-02025\n* **주요 사업:** 고주파 레이더 기반 비접촉 센서 신호처리, 정밀 알고리즘 설계 및 관련 하드웨어·소프트웨어 통합 솔루션 개발 (친환경 선박 및 스마트 센싱 기술 등)[2][3][4]\n\nSources:\n[1] [thevc.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFdcZF_08i-GfziPvTNrjBEogXmWLXj-ozzs0oiMjuXYd6uruh7CZvYIjYhBRVpxGDdP4BInG1Lw-IZNKooz96AbdntNoCl_sNY3S4P6Nq8)\n[2] [petabrew.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHg63UOqnByIWjm1xLFkKb8Jaays-4gKcoD4x85YLLzidEWBYc0X2i3PCPfPvc7lg4aNoHfTXras7zxHLfTt4hjGRIvkB4xTMVYsQ==)\n[3] [rndcircle.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGGMOcCHAru9QhW-S76clx7auBQv2tvDBfx4laeUUDMo1cIHEueJdBE88oOalPfeDKaqc9esVQbCUS8cf3JyvNvsGFjK5zMlTYPKD1F4HmadkPhBCISrM042hFf78UwVAJBwLiaQGqu9700o2IH6g2zAibE1GfA95age4E=)\n[4] [rndcircle.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdIgAoZRrALai3gNtnMIKsXJkZfvCMEtxgmy8SfVgUhEOZDqaW64hrxXW8Gj73ZxLZmgeZrOs74zYaKAg9DUD6oKUdxqySIsF7Zf8rwOmC3ZjS8U_9OLmtunhr5EX1EBEyhcTYFtbkkSnz9x-3ZrvBEIhnULHJ_5vmPVTWOonikYm94_0=)"}
